  "reviewer_note": "Contested. Iranica: nothing in the Gathas locates him; Avesta geography points to eastern Iran, perhaps the northeast rather than Sistan; later traditions say Azarbaijan and Media; arguments for Chorasmia and Sogdiana are called inconclusive. The pin at Mashhad is only a coarse marker for that region (1000 km); no source names Mashhad.",
